  "name": "食谱：纳博内番茄盅",
  "desc": "<p><span>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「纳博内番茄盅」的制作方法。</span></p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/955d23a38b8e91a5e5c9de7547d7a320_4590820434178027607.png",
